cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or data, please cite the associated manuscript
  and this archive.
type: software
title: >-
  Code and data for "Hidden thermal signatures reveal the microclimatic
  influence of scheduled cave tourism"
abstract: >-
  R pipeline and 10-minute air-temperature records from six monitoring
  points in Poole's Cavern (Buxton, UK), October 2019 to October 2021,
  reproducing Figures 6-11 of the manuscript.
